Manage Unified Stream Manager(USM).

Usage:
  confluent usm [command]

Aliases:
  usm, unified-stream-manager

Available Commands:
  connect-cluster Manage Confluent Cloud usm connect clusters.
  kafka-cluster   Manage Confluent Cloud usm kafka clusters.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent usm [command] --help" for more information about a command.
